Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

Thank you for contacting Arizona State University. For more information about our online programs, I recommend contacting a representative from ASU Online at 1-866-277-6589 or via chat (select Live Chat at the bottom of the page at http://asuonline.asu.edu/).

The representative will be able to provide you with the best information on our online programs as well as on tuition and other important information about registering for classes.

Sincerely,

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}
Admission Services
{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}


If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.

